# The root .gitignore ignores *.ifc (they're usually large build artifacts / project models),
# but this folder is the SHIPPED family library — track the generated core + curated externals.
#
# That includes the massing-families packs: they're first-party content, so they ship with the repo
# and a fresh clone has a stocked shelf with no build or fetch step. `scripts/fetch_families.py`
# refreshes them from a release when one is published.
!library.ifc
!external/*.ifc
!external/manifest.json
